      "text": "Yesterday morning, @Vermeullarmine published an op-ed worrying that lower courts were defying the Supreme Court. \n\nWithin 24 hours:\n\nA district judge in California enjoined termination of TPS—even though SCOTUS already stayed a TPS injunction.\n\nA district judge in DC blocked deportation of all parolees in the country—even after SCOTUS ended nationwide injunctions.\n\nAnd the DC Bar recommended disbarring Jeff Clark—after SCOTUS held that his conversations with President Trump were protected under Article II.\n\nLooks like Professor Vermuele may have been onto something!",
